<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Eye, eye, eye, eye!</l><l>Our eyes can see the night sky!</l><l>The great constellations we see over here</l><l>Are different from those you see elsewhere.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Eye, eye, eye, eye!</l><l>Our eyes can see the night sky!</l><l>The Milky Way Galaxy, oh, what a sight—</l><l>And comets and meteors shoot by!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Eye, eye, eye, eye!</l><l>Our eyes can see the night sky!</l><l>I thank You, Lord, for all the heavens we see,</l><l>The firmament shows that You love me!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
